00:21:02,180 --> 00:21:05,000
你去欧洲不仅仅是寻开心.你去那里是感受古老而丰富的文化.
You go there to experience an older richer culture.

280
00:21:05,800 --> 00:21:06,520
本:还有小便池?
Ben: Any more urinals?

281
00:21:08,640 --> 00:21:09,960
本:嘿!一定是爸爸妈妈.
Ben: Hey, that must be mum and dad.

282
00:21:10,640 --> 00:21:11,320
迈克:啊,听着,
Mike: Ah, well listen Ben.

283
00:21:11,320 --> 00:21:13,140
本.我真的认为我还没做好听他们讲述旅途.
I really don't think I'm ready to hear about their trip yet.Ok.

284
00:21:13,340 --> 00:21:15,680
好.他们一定会责怪我卖给他们的可恶的旅行.好了,
They'll probably blame me for selling them the lousy tour.

285
00:21:16,220 --> 00:21:16,400
如果他们问,就说我不在家.
Ok, if they ask, I'm not home.

286
00:21:17,520 --> 00:21:18,800
本:继续.我能够对付妈妈爸爸.相信我.
Ben: Go on.I can handle mum and dad.Trust me.

287
00:21:18,800 --> 00:21:20,800
迈克:好吧,谢谢.
Mike: Ok, thanks.

288
00:21:22,300 --> 00:21:24,540
麦琪:嗨,本.你好吗?
Maggie: Hey Ben.How are you?

289
00:21:25,420 --> 00:21:26,280
本:你们可回来了.
Ben: You guys are home.

290
00:21:26,280 --> 00:21:26,380
杰森:是呀.
Jason: Yeah.

291
00:21:27,400 --> 00:21:29,800
本:旅行怎么样?希望照片比迈克的更好.
Ben: Hhow was your trip?Hope the pictures are better than Mike's.

292
00:21:30,580 --> 00:21:31,440
杰森:迈克在家?
Jason: Mike's home?

293
00:21:33,040 --> 00:21:33,600
本:恩,
Ben: Um, Mike who.

294
00:21:35,780 --> 00:21:39,020
迈克?为什么要浪费时间谈论一个不在这儿的人呢?
Why are we wasting our time talking bout someone who's not even here?

295
00:21:39,420 --> 00:21:40,300
还是看看那些照片吧.
Let's see those darn pictures.

296
00:21:40,300 --> 00:21:45,500
麦琪:对不起,本.没有照片.不过我有很多明信片.
Maggie: Well sorry Ben.No pictures.But I do have plenty of postcards.

297
00:21:46,620 --> 00:21:48,400
本:嗨,你们看了那么多幽雅的地方?
Ben: Man, you guys saw a lot of neat stuff.

298
00:21:48,680 --> 00:21:49,920
麦琪:一个也没.
Maggie: Not any of it.

299
00:21:50,200 --> 00:21:51,700
克莉丝:妈咪,爸爸.
Chrissy: Mummy, daddy.

300
00:21:51,700 --> 00:21:51,800
杰森:我的小宝贝.
Jason: My baby.

301
00:21:51,800 --> 00:21:53,900
麦琪:克莉丝.
Maggie: Chrissy.

302
00:21:53,900 --> 00:21:57,580
外婆:感谢上帝,你们回来了.我打破的东西列了个清单.
Grandma: Thank god you are back.I wrote a check for the thingy I broke.

303
00:21:57,580 --> 00:21:59,240
大多数孩子都在家,我想.这星期我一直庆幸的是埃迪两天前就走了.
Most of your children are here I think.

304
00:21:59,420 --> 00:22:02,560
哦,别担心.
The only good thing about this week is Ed left two days ago.

305
00:22:02,740 --> 00:22:06,020
我乘出租车.再见.再见.
Oh,don't worry, I'll take a cab.See you.Bye!

306
00:22:09,460 --> 00:22:11,620
克莉丝:我认为这星期外婆过的不好.
Chrissy: I think grandma's had a tough week.

307
00:22:14,500 --> 00:22:15,500
本:喂!
Ben: Hello.

308
00:22:16,940 --> 00:22:20,700
开萝尔:比我想的更糟,本.爸爸和妈妈彻底失踪了.
Carol: It's worse than I thought Ben.Mum and dad have completely disappeared.

309
00:22:21,260 --> 00:22:24,420
这样的话,看来我不得不在这儿待上几星期了.本:爸爸,
At this rate it looks like I may have to stay here a couple of weeks.

310
00:22:25,160 --> 00:22:26,980
我认为你最好来处理这事.00:22:23,900
Ben: Dad, I think you better handle this one.
